entries.en:
I’ve never heard of making salt
using metal boards. We must remove rust constantly,
otherwise our salt turns brown. It's a lot of work.

He wants to do something
for society in the right way. He knows it's hard,
but I think my husband will make it happen somehow.

You are right. I thought about that
for the first time then. Before we got married,
I was arrested by the military police.
